  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16df14f7254f4c15a684c1c7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "穿上这身衣服，就连吃饭时\r\n也有种奇妙的感觉。「我要开动了」\r\n都会讲得特别大声呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ff85ff0475251e5f91796d2a7c921fe4e3603f219cb9780c0e611d0d2dec9bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6633a77ea660412381b42398",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下午时段总是会忍不住想睡……\r\n明明和大家一起熬夜研究文献时，\r\n我都能够轻松击败睡意的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02faa4e33536a0ff66f49a88f42014cc380c3d7327dbc89b60c819daa8219779",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a9d862b6582a0d327a786d7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……真是安静耶。这时要是\r\n响起几声蹄铁声，彷佛又可以\r\n重现神马驱」那一晚呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0af10c0f1fb11c7e6eeeeb3e171cd62ac43f13887301ee43205b57c2ac32d543",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5afdbeec9b9b88291151948c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夜晚走在路上时，擦身而过的人\r\n突然对我双手合十……我是不是\r\n被误以为成什么神的化身了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c73b80a0f8accffa871bd587d8fd0232586ec110011e0820dac82ee40aef28cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3f7e04c1b6dfe879b8c2dd2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春天是宴会的季节！\r\n我就在飞舞的花瓣之中舞一曲，\r\n为赏花增添回忆吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a4020b385a93704be8c26c8dd504d15a8c6451c851f8fc6502b47074c48552",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9599b66e3558521967f56531",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "祭典时炒热气氛是很重要啦，\r\n但热闹之余也千万不能忘记\r\n世世代代传承下来的意志呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abdd41f2b90da7f0f122085cb3426d0772c13b96bbaa51fb5b0ee175d24f07cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed15ce73144aac1e6f887cd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "俗话说「秋高气爽赛马娘肥」呢。\r\n好好感谢季节的恩惠，\r\n尽情享用美味料理吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbfa15da4227dc3994cecb1b446239309a1c92e9f1412128a51aebd75d28e725",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc40675e44214418f2cb7766",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "趁年底好好把环境内外扫干净吧。\r\n这样才能以清爽干净地迎接新年啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3f4bda4c8145614a049e9a17a8598a0798fc50a68b0ac908e8cc653c4d6d67c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfebddc3e2bdf104c90d6627",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c77da4bc1d901684670880",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3392f375336329bbc62e118d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喔，大姐！嘿嘿嘿，\r\n一大早就表现得睡眼惺忪，\r\n可是有损江户之子的名声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "767c750224c03f158b38c0a70e4480e5c20faf4bb010154c1337a2c08992e02d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90100"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/90100"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:282e84ac4df77cc2c608e5be",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "闻着榻榻米的味道睡午觉感觉\r\n特别不一样。所以我在宿舍的房间\r\n也铺了榻榻米！",
      "source_fingerprint": "095c0cd76f37f17ee50e77fea0d681d2a14279be554cf7c9bd41419ba2dfd18d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dec6aa1058a6b479391d522b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "受到爸爸的影响，我很擅长\r\n自己在假日做木工。\r\n如果需要什么东西就跟我说吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffcad95a146c022e17fc1dc4a91fb69ffe35a89a877da988aaf583e8548576ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e8c5cd4ea22ca76d8391cc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果小玉是大阪代表，\r\n那我就是亮眼的江户代表！\r\n我绝对不能输给她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "103cc745e44163441f38b35a7dc1c7c8eaf84338cd4d3ae6bfa74a16dfdaa736",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42506ceefec0b50754ad1c8b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗的吃相真是豪迈！\r\n……可以的话，\r\n我都想请她吃东西了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0788df8614def03ee8bcded73a5e7beb3f0ae5b181c9422165a92ede32ff2645",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0007b70d2fe0e60712b80649",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老街区的传统游戏大多\r\n有点粗鲁。如果溪流之类的人\r\n看见，或许会吓得昏倒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d3022e705e1bd6d745a07fa139ed02baed0579e5e465a5b0d8fa547aa3c6b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a97b0cd940b34610c4de060c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是特别日子穿的服装吧。\r\n既然打扮得这么潇洒，\r\n就来跳一整晚的舞吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55bae88a9a50fb83013580198ab68ecee50d3172fb31c6580adb9acb122e5024",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95cb16275bc590933e104625",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "祭典最大的亮点就是跳舞！\r\n就由我来当舞台的主角吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d1ade469964541b7132a123c53713d14c1300650ab2e7e1369eeb987c25c21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9640d53f73908cfa38ef8b28",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，用这个打扮扛神轿也不错。\r\n在比赛中拿下胜利，\r\n热闹地庆祝一番吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39ae231beecf8a0344ddd34760434b767c869bb15e4b2d0e531ed7f1d2d497af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15c50d99bae47ac3032c5ea6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "穿上这件衣服后，身体感觉就\r\n变得蠢蠢欲动。\r\n干脆去跑一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00340f82383d739ca2b5b3afe6f81d829e63b58a0129c72a5298f68841b98ec9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9017f9f2c73522d9ee71fe8c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "晨练后洗澡特别舒服！\r\n你也试试看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48f617580dbb2aceb25e40e83b778c698f0cdd697d06e16bc78bb37457dc9e23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c829c9cca45137b3e737445f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然食堂的餐点很好吃，\r\n但偶尔也自己做荞麦面吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51f642dba8c3bc7b16cbddb5d5596367cf006b9a6ee7c23bf483c98d05a93086",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c4dd9fdc30a45e9889930bd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──哈啾！\r\n怎么了，是有人在谈论我……\r\n不对，是天气变冷啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff50ccad62ec0d1cec5a1067d1614039d359af50cc081e92dc4b29993b73a6cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8679e2f4f4ca758bda0d7dd0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天气变暖了。\r\n去海边趁退潮时捡些贝类回来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cc2256da0d5355376918bb4ef39c0cbae8774ebb3f06dd0d9a9863edbb94096",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb7d3caeec423fe7cda484dd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天气这么热，应该会害一些人\r\n状态变差。多带一些\r\n能分给其他人的水吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dee3d31a5f1365fc3407b44b8375401abefe27cf34fcc3d912a0d88a1ed63f9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ac4f82735230e12b7afaeb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赏枫感觉还挺风雅的。\r\n去找间不错的神社吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d571bc202174a43a30371c8fe6f409bdca8491810ed52eda3aa3c63e95d9c84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434044ecfd9f6a6a7c4e40d2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是的，冷到都起鸡皮疙瘩了。\r\n这种时候还是多活动身体，\r\n才是最好的作法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e33857f0a1593ff45093c7875de57374385fe1af136814675ddb37927362fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a59e470f78fb0f49883b511c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小玉烤的章鱼烧简直是专家等级呢。\r\n不过我也回礼了一番，让她体会到\r\n文字烧焦脆的美学就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34f8604cc09e442d0cdcda76b2313ba5042799a5a3ec73746478ee9f18f2811c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df56ebac4033cfd50c590669",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跟小栗一起去参拜……\r\n她竟然一双手合十\r\n就反射性地说出「我要开动了」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b065ecf3de8ae0dec40e0acc56eb80ce0ac3d6e0347710e7d0e258ade284d92d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d22a25858dbbf187d655f2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跟阿尔丹一起去参加神社祭典，\r\n结果她开始讲起那间神社的历史，\r\n还吸引一批听众变成了历史讲座呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bda7dbbeaaaa6364b5207b885b622900fce936e8d80e78391afdadcfa019451",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b23a2331a05cd5043ba9ae4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重在祭典负责打太鼓。\r\n她的气势惊人到彷佛要打破鼓面，\r\n连跳舞的人都忍不住热血沸腾呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa84e01081ef9cb32ab81c9c20a18fd1e053cdf953b469b8ea181224ff480d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ad026460f9f8b79960492c9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在集训宿舍泡澡真是个特别的回忆。\r\n记得「神马驱」结束后我们一起\r\n泡在浴池里边看星星边唱歌呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "148a6998149b3862718d18769462ffc73f3c9ae8a4f5a855971bb075e2b40127",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:292ddcd8d499f57aa3e99078",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我梦到三女神，\r\n还跟祂们一起抬神轿喔。\r\n……那也算是所谓的「神谕」吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b396624c9676322775daf4e909e607f6daa078f882672204250dfd62912ce9c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3c83a103167ce677f81d29",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你饿不饿啊？\r\n嘿嘿，其实我在袖子里\r\n藏了几个人形烧喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "718ba142c80d0ac9bdd0051910e51917e92281daac49b40e41c0045b69ad6043",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b8e166cf363d04e7fe28e5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先祈祷完再睡好了。\r\n希望我们赛马娘可以\r\n永远充满热情地奔跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e42c6dc29dc308df8aac9105a82fca0172b06d79a489720a47f15d2ac89f1c86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c1d71c4862ffaf19ca2f9ba",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我喜欢的餐厅开始贩卖赏花便当了。\r\n我们就边品尝包着竹笋炊饭的\r\n豆皮寿司边赏花吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff63b4d7596cee4a771f3b4a9029d4774619cce0b39d745c80dde66b1c6486e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9b956f32b2aac6321733043",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到消暑当然就是要在土用丑日\r\n吃鳗鱼啦。大口享用洒满山椒的\r\n鳗鱼饭，真是比什么都享受！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d4052beed3ddf19806f2fcf64b82f916c276886d03612f11ad9de959c87176",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c792a4eb86f193b50c76015",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听说芒草因为长得像赛马娘的尾巴，\r\n所以也被称做尾花。然后它似乎\r\n还能用来驱邪，真是吉祥的植物啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06ec6be3d76baa67cf1a2cceda736494cec16e7fc58105f6f83d4f13c97ccd8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f8e271ba127d16070f7965",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天气真的开始变冷了呢。我就跳一首\r\n这次「思织」中学到的\r\n热血舞蹈来驱赶寒气吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18aea959791b492fddc35c57c29329dc4486313088c3b5ab2423e4b808018c60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91027"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91027"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50e09c64dbd2df9d91b0464e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "肩负起无数愿望，在「此刻」\r\n绽放光彩并创造未来……这就是\r\n穿上这身服装的人应尽的职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5781ddaae4d3939ace0994ac444a1f9219cdb8c162b8c79070cb0291c977abe4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91028"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91028"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd5049b5a26e43846dc2c486",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "绑这个发型的时候，后辈们经常\r\n就会来摸我的头发。\r\n口中还说着好柔软蓬松之类的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f172959fd3a67c27eb707ca13f835fc6f625afd9233696df602c2b9375b905c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "91029"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/91029"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4757cd9324c138618cd418",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿嘿，稻荷大人接下来的表现，\r\n将会让人大吃一惊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e98dbd1f3bbfcd9e169e4cd7bfafdd34938b5ec7fe6fd03d2ce4c6d896f773e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1008b49f9e144d6e5136409",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "行くぜい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29fdb8e596e65eecea53a3f7f0553f17146a9638d1b8dbef2651b576aff9bd55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "920000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/920000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53d7e32b2e3e07a9888e5ea6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "少废话，别跟我客气！\r\n我就是想接受严苛的训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b02357531fcfd5f288133083216ed1bb2bcac6e6ae8e06cfb80c7617751494f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88716d888311fe215d03c8b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不管是什么训练内容，\r\n我都会迎着风潇洒完成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "647c3d2fc0c2ae43af2ee6bf5382b6ac97f68beec1bf4227c3db5f73d10a7908",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c35ae091b47b8faedf3b12f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在别人看不见的地方认真才潇洒……\r\n所以扎实地持续锻炼，\r\n也是江户之子该有的心态！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c55b68bafa53dd68b2e068863edeb57b0fb413ae3fc300566cf73cb4f48d13d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c585fa11fdebac136f29724",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有搭档真的很棒呢。\r\n只要有人陪在自己身边，\r\n不管什么辛苦都能忍受！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ba4b2e641f4b57fa279fcc14da6bf3125a1ba621a245649eb6fd7fff2b4e48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f4099b7cb7d60b0a321e74",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感觉只要跟大哥在一起，\r\n不管做什么都会很顺利。\r\n以后也要一起参加祭典喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab10ecf3e55b705a05b1a23b728c7d6ee6828a9e19abcc084e887f55913553b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e2430acc33a925e328051fd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要一直保持潇洒也很不容易。\r\n不过只要大哥在身边看着我，\r\n我就不会松懈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe04ca537539c9a0c9b7da1b11c3fa2e9309627cd36f5701be202f32af9f5b95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ff6d2ff529b2dc5b217672",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我已经开始期待全力鼓起干劲训练，\r\n在浴室冲掉身上的海水和汗水了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9e8a71d0addca5532e207eb1f1d54f488e7e0861b809cb2e645e115e60b5699",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1374cc519bdf19155a9e805c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好啦，出发吧！\r\n将这股燃烧的热情\r\n灌注于双腿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c6d35a891b57c2cf6d35df588f5235fd3b73e6b648c603ba0733ce4a22b30db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:780989381b37f77412726269",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这套衣服虽然看起来很宽松，\r\n但其实超级好活动的喔。就让大家\r\n见识见识韦驮天的利落身手吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a02437737e7521173a85a6df42bde3cbadfde0ff72de803bb2f96a4d104d898",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cfb8e2fcc70bea4fb65fd30",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看我怎么一面潇洒地舞动袖子，\r\n一面华丽地完成所有训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f18f7ada9121818e3c04e761406b7ae5f0613d8dc3654cbbd680c156c4216da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d8ef464fe37654bbf40a05e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够一直平安健康地奔跑\r\n真是件值得感恩的事。\r\n得把这点铭记在心好好努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c9fbcb2b5904f7b328321384823ccd132d45de027c5e885b0d896c9063f9532",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33771ec565872ff99fc0a48",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要肩负起所有比赛选手们\r\n难以计数的心意！\r\n绝不漏掉任何一个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12ec9904a63f09091513b2f02b21187b5058f6f2a05f7674d31cc12ff57df575",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc8bab978c6c8c592424bf1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将我跟你的意念\r\n都深深刻画进历史吧！\r\n绝不留下任何遗憾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "152220101cee98858cd6c610dc1cd5c59783878a30673b2e5453ff165405ddc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "92021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1034/92021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32141283b275b982c1850f24",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "永远流传的转瞬光辉──\r\n就是我想跑出的表现！\r\n拜托你啦，大哥！",
